        "title": "Marketing - Landscape Overview",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Marketing is one discipline pretending to be a dozen. The confusion is that\n\"marketing\" names the *whole strategy* (who do we serve, how do we win) and a\n*specific function* (the ads, the email, the website) at the same time. The\nlandscape below is the whole stack, top to bottom: from a market down to a\nsingle tracked conversion."
